# Data & generated artifacts
# NOTE: data/corpus/*.pdf and data/eval_dataset.jsonl ARE committed on purpose.
# The demo corpus is synthetic (generated by scripts/make_demo_corpus.py) and the
# dataset is ground truth -- both are required to reproduce the benchmark.
# User-uploaded documents and the vector index are NOT.
data/uploads/
data/chroma_db*/
data/benchmark_*/
data/!excluded/
data/**/*.pdf
!data/corpus/*.pdf
results/*.csv
results/*.json
results/*.png
results/*.md
!results/.gitkeep
!results/README.md

